{"Cached value isn't re-checked after acquiring the write lock, causing each waiter to re-read after the first goroutine releases the lock": 0.9714159369468689, "Write lock is taken before doing network/file I/O, which can cause serialized and repeated manifest reads under concurrent requests": 0.9743680953979492, "In dev mode, the current implementation unnecessarily serializes every call": 0.9615423679351807, "Should only use the mutex to coordinate cache reads/writes and re-check the cache under the exclusive lock, while doing expensive I/O without holding the lock": 0.8974214196205139, "Missing concurrency-focused test (run under go test -race) that calls GetWebAssets from multiple goroutines to prevent regressions of the data race and verify caching behavior under contention": 0.7710556983947754}